@title PLC rows: two Draw rows, the I/O list in the Import centre, Send to PLC on right-click
@area Layout
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane V4k (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). Draw > PLC (4 rows) is gone: Add PLC card and
# PLC overview are plain Draw rows, Import I/O list is a tile of the Import centre next to Import PLC
# tags, and Send signal to PLC is a row of the right-click menu of a selected symbol.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Draw #1
wait 6
shot draw-menu
expect "Add PLC card"
expect "PLC overview"
expect_not "Send signal to PLC"
expect_not "Import I/O list"
key Escape
wait 4
click_text File #1
wait 6
click_text "Import..."
wait 10
shot import-centre
expect "Import I/O list"
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
click 579 320 right
wait 10
shot right-click
expect "Send to PLC"
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
